WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.664
Step 1. Open the pharmacy service. Select Services in the facility sidebar.

2.1
00:00:06.664 --> 00:00:13.319
Step 2. Open the pharmacy location. Select View Prescriptions on its card.

3.1
00:00:13.319 --> 00:00:19.558
Step 3. Select a tab. Billing Pending lists the active prescriptions.

4.1
00:00:19.558 --> 00:00:25.084
Step 4. Find a prescription. Use the filters above the queue.

5.1
00:00:25.084 --> 00:00:32.113
Step 5. Show the prescriptions of one patient. Select the patient's name in a row.

6.1
00:00:32.113 --> 00:00:34.616
Step 6. Act on a prescription.

6.2
00:00:34.616 --> 00:00:39.846
To close it without billing, select Mark Prescription Complete.
